cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the software and the associated article."
title: "Analysis code: Area-level social disadvantage and geographic access to the dental workforce in the United States"
abstract: >
  R code reproducing a national cross-sectional analysis of dental workforce
  availability across 26,285 U.S. ZIP Code Tabulation Areas, including
  catchment-based supply measures, dental and specialist desert outcomes,
  comparison across three area-level disadvantage indices, and exploratory
  state Medicaid policy correlations.
type: software
